1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,240
Sosu, my target has appeared.

2
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:20,500
Konvosusu. Dimara Sosu.

3
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:25,640
Hey, wait!

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Huh?

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Forearms, high body temperature.

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,000
The scent of the sun.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
A hollow?

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
But she's... she's so well put together.

9
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Same as Nanachi.

10
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Sosu, what has happened to your arm?

11
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Did somebody hurt you?

12
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Reg!

13
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Reg!

14
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Reg.

15
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Have I... have I met her before?

16
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Who did this, Sosu?

17
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:17,000
What? Who are you?

18
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Are you the one who left us that creepy note before?

19
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Hmm...

20
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Oh!

21
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Oh!

22
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Oh!

23
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Oh!

24
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Hadima...

25
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Oogu?

26
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,000
What is it?

27
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Hey!

28
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Furu-de-fur-bearer?

29
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Do not like lots of eyes looking, Sosu.

30
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,000
What?

31
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,000
What?

32
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Fakta.

33
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Born out of longing.

34
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:52,000
A longing too fragile, too deep.

35
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,000
You left her to posterity.

36
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,000
You had to...

37
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,000
You had to...

38
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:03,000
you had to...

39
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,000
We had...

40
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Fear.

41
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,000
We had...

42
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,000
Letam out of your soul...

43
00:03:30,001 --> 00:03:40,081
The comm device isn't getting through. Must be blocked or something.

44
00:03:40,781 --> 00:03:43,141
Aw, jeez. I hope he's not being reckless.

45
00:03:43,661 --> 00:03:46,281
Hagi. Nice smelling fluffy one.

46
00:03:46,481 --> 00:03:47,021
Snannichi.

47
00:03:47,661 --> 00:03:53,381
Nice smelling nannichi. You have yet to change your value into iru, currency.

48
00:03:53,381 --> 00:04:00,121
There is water and fruit for your sustenance, but here value is needed to train.

49
00:04:00,521 --> 00:04:02,661
I see. What should I do?

50
00:04:03,281 --> 00:04:06,341
Would stomping on that flat guy get me some extra value?

51
00:04:07,781 --> 00:04:10,921
Hey, Maji Kaja. About that balancing thing.

52
00:04:11,321 --> 00:04:14,501
Was it what Riko said that decided the amount of Mania's value?

53
00:04:14,921 --> 00:04:15,761
Inga, no.

54
00:04:16,501 --> 00:04:17,381
It wasn't?

55
00:04:17,381 --> 00:04:22,861
Kaja said before, but iru buru, the village knows everyone's desires.

56
00:04:23,381 --> 00:04:26,841
And how, you might ask? By looking at signals.

57
00:04:27,121 --> 00:04:29,601
At signals? You mean in your head?

58
00:04:29,761 --> 00:04:36,981
The head alone is not sufficient. They are deeper. Signals of the soul that include one's connections.

59
00:04:37,481 --> 00:04:41,621
No matter what the mouth says, signals of the soul cannot be fooled.

60
00:04:41,661 --> 00:04:45,741
But aren't there people who really believe the lies that they tell themselves?

61
00:04:45,741 --> 00:04:52,521
If the soul is unsteady, one can fool themselves with their own words. Their truth is their own.

62
00:04:52,521 --> 00:04:56,141
Before long, it becomes a signal of the soul.

63
00:04:56,721 --> 00:04:59,101
Minyu, what is of value to Nanachi?

64
00:04:59,641 --> 00:05:00,361
To me?

65
00:05:01,801 --> 00:05:03,101
Let me think.

66
00:05:03,481 --> 00:05:04,521
Mitty and...

67
00:05:05,201 --> 00:05:05,701
Padi.

68
00:05:06,341 --> 00:05:06,701
Mitty.

69
00:05:07,341 --> 00:05:08,241
Yeah, Mitty.

70
00:05:08,721 --> 00:05:10,001
And the people I'm with.

71
00:05:10,341 --> 00:05:11,621
Don't care about the rest.

72
00:05:11,621 --> 00:05:13,161
Kaja understands.

73
00:05:13,161 --> 00:05:15,901
Mitty smells very nice.

74
00:05:15,901 --> 00:05:17,641
Kaja wants her as well.

75
00:05:17,641 --> 00:05:21,021
Though Beloff of the three sages is using her.

76
00:05:21,481 --> 00:05:22,921
Oh, Mitty.

77
00:05:23,521 --> 00:05:28,421
That warm mass of the torturous curse the masked man left cruelly behind.

78
00:05:32,861 --> 00:05:35,381
Hey, what do you mean?

79
00:05:35,381 --> 00:05:39,621
Maya, the three sages are the ones who created this place.

80
00:05:39,721 --> 00:05:40,501
Not that part.

81
00:05:40,761 --> 00:05:41,101
Huh?

82
00:05:41,581 --> 00:05:43,541
Was I mistaken in what you said?

83
00:05:44,281 --> 00:05:47,501
The masked man left who behind exactly?

84
00:05:47,501 --> 00:05:47,621
Huh?

85
00:05:57,621 --> 00:05:59,701
Where am I?

86
00:05:59,701 --> 00:06:09,241
Why are you being like this?

87
00:06:09,701 --> 00:06:11,821
Did you also forget this place, Sosu?

88
00:06:12,161 --> 00:06:15,041
I feel bad about replying to a question with a question.

89
00:06:15,281 --> 00:06:17,781
But what kind of relationship is there between you and me?

90
00:06:18,781 --> 00:06:20,921
I feel as though I've met you before.

91
00:06:21,601 --> 00:06:25,801
But, well, it would seem I might have lost my memories of that time.

92
00:06:26,121 --> 00:06:28,821
I want to know what I am and all the memories I lost.

93
00:06:28,821 --> 00:06:31,221
So, if you know, then please tell me.

94
00:06:36,741 --> 00:06:39,041
Fopta must check to see if you're you.

95
00:06:39,341 --> 00:06:40,381
If you're really reg.

96
00:06:40,681 --> 00:06:41,901
Then Fopta will answer.

97
00:06:42,241 --> 00:06:43,361
That's all right with me?

98
00:06:47,161 --> 00:06:50,401
I just gotta hope she doesn't notice the comm device.

99
00:06:51,721 --> 00:06:53,181
Show Fopta that too, Sosu.

100
00:06:53,181 --> 00:06:53,561
Oh.

101
00:06:57,561 --> 00:06:58,081
Hey.

102
00:06:58,821 --> 00:07:00,261
Aren't you going to ask me anything?

103
00:07:04,101 --> 00:07:07,321
Even though you're Fopta's, who'd do this?

104
00:07:11,741 --> 00:07:13,501
What is this wound, Sosu?

105
00:07:13,941 --> 00:07:15,441
No, no, don't touch it.

106
00:07:15,521 --> 00:07:17,001
It's not fully healed just yet.

107
00:07:17,001 --> 00:07:20,901
I, I can't move.

108
00:07:20,901 --> 00:07:26,181
Taste is the same.

109
00:07:26,181 --> 00:07:43,081
Taste is the same.

110
00:07:43,081 --> 00:07:49,321
You said you would bring Haku back here, Sosu.

111
00:07:58,201 --> 00:08:00,501
Human child or hollow child?

112
00:08:01,001 --> 00:08:03,201
Which one is it you call your Haku, Sosu?

113
00:08:03,201 --> 00:08:04,701
What'd you say?

114
00:08:04,701 --> 00:08:04,761
What'd you say?

115
00:08:04,761 --> 00:08:05,961
Haku?

116
00:08:05,961 --> 00:08:07,001
Haku.

117
00:08:07,001 --> 00:08:09,301
One's highest valued thing.

118
00:08:09,301 --> 00:08:10,641
One's most dear.

119
00:08:12,701 --> 00:08:14,981
Yes, you are Fopta's reg.

120
00:08:14,981 --> 00:08:16,481
Show me just in case.

121
00:08:16,481 --> 00:08:17,981
You leave me alone.

122
00:08:17,981 --> 00:08:25,981
I came here to find out who I am, not get violated.

123
00:08:25,981 --> 00:08:30,161
And first of all, you shouldn't know me as Reg.

124
00:08:30,161 --> 00:08:32,821
That's the name Riko gave me on the surface.

125
00:08:32,821 --> 00:08:34,481
