126
00:08:34,481 --> 00:08:37,121
Reg was also Reg before Riko.

127
00:08:37,121 --> 00:08:41,901
It would appear speaking with you is proving to be pointless.

128
00:08:41,901 --> 00:08:44,001
Fopta is not lying!

129
00:08:45,201 --> 00:08:47,601
Reg, where are you going, Sosu?

130
00:08:48,341 --> 00:08:50,301
Sorry, but I'll be heading back now.

131
00:08:50,821 --> 00:08:52,721
Riko and Nanachi are waiting for me.

132
00:08:52,821 --> 00:08:58,521
Reg, so you want to live in the same time as the human child?

133
00:08:59,421 --> 00:09:01,841
Even when they die, you will stay the same.

134
00:09:02,241 --> 00:09:03,661
What will you do, Sosu?

135
00:09:07,361 --> 00:09:10,361
I'll stay with them until the very end, as a friend should.

136
00:09:10,361 --> 00:09:14,561
And when the time comes, I'll have to deal with it, then.

137
00:09:20,441 --> 00:09:24,901
Egu, Egu, Konbu, Sosu.

138
00:09:33,721 --> 00:09:35,061
That clock tower.

139
00:09:36,121 --> 00:09:38,381
I saw it when we first came down here.

140
00:09:40,361 --> 00:09:45,801
Don't attack me, okay?

141
00:09:46,541 --> 00:09:47,401
I'm leaving.

142
00:09:50,441 --> 00:09:51,961
Damn it.

143
00:09:52,261 --> 00:09:53,581
My stupid body.

144
00:09:54,261 --> 00:09:56,341
My bigger injuries heal up right away.

145
00:09:57,421 --> 00:10:01,401
So Fopta, the embodiment of value, will never perish.

146
00:10:01,401 --> 00:10:04,301
She certainly was very beautiful.

147
00:10:05,301 --> 00:10:08,381
But what did I do to her in the past for her to act that way?

148
00:10:09,461 --> 00:10:10,501
So you...

149
00:10:10,501 --> 00:10:13,701
You want to live in the same time as the human child?

150
00:10:15,101 --> 00:10:16,081
Makes me wonder.

151
00:10:17,141 --> 00:10:20,001
Back then, how would I have answered that question?

152
00:10:20,901 --> 00:10:22,661
Even if I get my memories back,

153
00:10:23,361 --> 00:10:23,961
will I...

154
00:10:23,961 --> 00:10:26,601
Will I be able to stay the way I am?

155
00:10:34,601 --> 00:10:36,941
