158
00:10:42,041 --> 00:10:44,121
Petals of the flowers of fortitude.

159
00:10:44,121 --> 00:10:46,121
And all these...

160
00:10:46,701 --> 00:10:48,281
All these nameplates.

161
00:10:50,281 --> 00:10:53,121
Eternal fortunes are scattered for celebrations and...

162
00:10:53,941 --> 00:10:54,941
And funerals.

163
00:10:56,021 --> 00:10:58,121
Are all these people...

164
00:10:58,661 --> 00:10:59,301
Deceased?

165
00:11:00,101 --> 00:11:01,621
